{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/tarary.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな「たらちゃんイケメン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"」\nなぁちゃん「たらおと呼べですぅ。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"た、た、たらおぉぉぉぉおおお！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"画像はZeppのイベの前に\n世の中に不条理を感じるたらお\nこと、西野七瀬"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と一緒に撮りました＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちアイドルの男装とか\n大好きなんですよね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cherry.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は今の待ち受けも\nアイドルの男装なのですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/sun.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( ゜_ゝ゜)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロングだったことある？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n全然ありますよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/bud.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中３までは\nロングとかミディアムでした＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すきなアニメは？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nアニメ全然見なくて\nわかりません(´;ω;｀)\nヲタはヲタでも\nアイドルヲタクの方でして…\nオヌヌメあれば\n教えてくらさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンレの宛先は？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n〒102-8353 東京都千代田区六番町4番地5「乃木坂46運営事務局」宛\n「文章を書くのが下手なのですが…」\n「字が下手なのですが…」\nそんなん気になりませんよ～！\n老若男女問わず待ってます＼^^／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはヲタクのブログですか？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nはい(・ω・)\nって、えーーーー！Σ(・ロ・ノ)ノ\nアイドルのブログですよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【お詫び】\nDD、MD、ngng、gdgd、等\n度々わかりにくい言葉が多いですが\n誠に勝手ながら\nググっていただけると幸いです\nすみません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\n乃木どこ見て\nry見て←\n寝よーっと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cat.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあした(¨)ノ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}